   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internship of Ukrainian diplomat of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Ukraine to Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">St&#xe1;&#x17e; ukrajinsk&#xe9;ho diplomata Ministerstva zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; UA na MZVaEZ SR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;The Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic and the Slovak Agency for International Development Cooperation invited Mr&#xa0;Andrii Filipchuk to attend an&#xa0;internship program in Slovakia.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;The internship is organized and funded by the Center for Experience Transfer on Integration and Reforms (CETIR), a&#xa0;program of the Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic and the Slovak Agency for International Development Cooperation (SAIDC).&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Supervising department of the internship at the Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic: &lt;i&gt;Eastern Europe, South Caucasus and Central Asia Department&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;(3TEO)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;V nadv&#xe4;znosti na 600.013/2014-ORPO a&#xa0;rokovania MiZaEZ M.Laj&#x10d;&#xe1;ka s&#xa0;jeho ukrajinsk&#xfd;m partnerom A.De&#x161;&#x10d;icom v&#xa0;Kyjeve, po&#x10d;as ktor&#xfd;ch ukrajinsk&#xe1; strana prijala ponuku na absolvovanie kr&#xe1;tkodobej st&#xe1;&#x17e;e 1 ukrajinsk&#xe9;ho diplomata na MZVaEZ SR.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Obsah/zameranie aktivity&lt;font face=&quot;Calibri&quot; size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Calibri&quot; size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Prijat&#xed;m ukrajinsk&#xe9;ho diplomata Andrija Filipchuka&#xa0;na kr&#xe1;tkodob&#xfa; prax na MZVaEZ SR sa podeli&#x165; so sk&#xfa;senos&#x165;ami z&#xa0;pr&#xe1;ce MZVaEZ a&#xa0;z v&#xfd;konu konkr&#xe9;tnej eur&#xf3;pskej agendy v rezorte ministerstva zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed;.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Realiz&#xe1;ciou aktivity podpori&#x165; eur&#xf3;pske smerovanie Ukrajiny.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Z&#xed;ska&#x165; na ukrajinskom MZV konkr&#xe9;tneho predstavite&#x13e;a, ktor&#xfd; by bol schopn&#xfd; odovzd&#xe1;va&#x165; nadobudnut&#xe9; sk&#xfa;senosti pri realiz&#xe1;cii bud&#xfa;cich integra&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch krokov UA smerom k&#xa0;EU.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
